+    ``known`` is ``batch_names | taken``, and it needs both halves: ``taken`` dedupes WITHIN
+    one call (two parents in one wave naming one child), ``batch_names`` — which this call
+    grows — is the only thing that carries an adoption ACROSS calls, so a later parent whose
+    record names a child an earlier wave already adopted is skipped rather than scheduling,
+    driving and announcing one bundle twice
+    (``test_a_child_adopted_earlier_is_not_re_adopted_by_a_later_parent``).
